{"code":"YL13","wikidata":"Q119010548","wikipedia":{"en":"Si Nut MRT station","th":"สถานีศรีนุช"},"summary":{"en":"Si Nut station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Srinagarindra Road in Suan Luang District, Bangkok and is a portmanteau of the names of Srinagarindra and On Nut roads, which intersect adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีศรีนุช เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนศรีนครินทร์บริเวณใกล้ทางแยกสวนหลวง ในพื้นที่เขตสวนหลวง กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-06-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Si_Nut_Station_01.jpg/960px-Si_Nut_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Nut_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Si_Nut_Station_02.jpg/960px-Si_Nut_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Nut_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Si_Nut_Station_03.jpg/960px-Si_Nut_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Nut_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Si_Nut_Station_04.jpg/960px-Si_Nut_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Nut_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Si_Nut_Station_05.jpg/960px-Si_Nut_Station_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaig